# SHA-256 of every Qt SDK archive the qt-sdk stage of ci/images/arch/Dockerfile
# downloads, in `find | sort` order (ADR-0103). The image build fails when the
# downloaded archives differ and prints the actual list.

# Qt 6.8.3, recorded from the first image build on 2026-10-09; aqtinstall had
# verified each archive against the Qt repository's SHA-256.
